 "origem": "gringa: Brasil (português): os ~65 prédios inclinados da orla de Santos, sapatas rasas sobre argila marinha mole; o Núncio Malzoni foi reaprumado com macacos hidráulicos em 2001 https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Santos,_S%C3%A3o_Paulo",
 "titulo": "Why the beach towers of Santos are leaning 🇧🇷 #engineering #shorts",
 "capa": "65 LEANING TOWERS",
 "descripcion": "Walk the beach in Santos, Brazil, and dozens of apartment towers lean like dominoes. The reason is a hidden layer of soft clay, and foundations that stop too soon.\n\nWhat should we explain next?\n\n#engineering #brazil #santos #foundations #shorts",
 "tags": [
